  protoWhitelist: ["vless", "trojan", "ss", "vmess", "vless-xhttp", "trojan-xhttp", "vless-xhttp1", "trojan-xhttp1", "vmess-grpc", "vless-grpc", "trojan-grpc"],   /*P155:6 — xhttp1 = stream-one + padding ضد-DPI (jacobax/snippets، Xray 25.x/v2rayNG 2.3.9+)*/   // P56-B: مجموعهٔ کامل (کوانتومها برگشتند — خواستهٔ مالک: همهٔ قابلیت‌ها خودکار)
  // v2.15 «طوفان۲» — THE 12 SUPER SPEED ENGINES. The core's entire speed
  // machinery, named and visible (panel /api/engines + bot /engines). Engines
  // 9 and 10 (dnscache + dnspre) are NEW in v2.15; the other ten are the
